<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-LEADING TIMES IN LONG BEACH QUALIFYING.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-LEADING TIMES IN LONG BEACH QUALIFYING.</headline>
<dateline>LONG BEACH, California 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading times</p>
<p>in provisional qualifying Friday for Sunday's Long Beach Grand</p>
<p>Prix CART IndyCar race (tabulate under driver, chassis, motor,</p>
<p>time)</p>
<p>1. Gil de Ferran (Brazil), Reynard-Honda, 51.293 seconds</p>
<p>(average speed 111.313 mph/179.214)</p>
<p>2. Maurcio Gugelmin (Brazil), Reynard Mercedes-Benz, 51.745</p>
<p>3. Alessandro Zanardi (Italy), Reynard Honda, 51.843</p>
<p>4. Bobby Rahal (U.S.), Reynard Ford Cosworth, 52.020</p>
<p>5. Bryan Herta (U.S.), Reynard Ford Cosworth, 52.069</p>
<p>6. Paul Tracy (Canada), Penske Mercedes-Benz, 52.078</p>
<p>7. Raul Boesel (Brazil), Reynard Ford Cosworth, 52.184</p>
<p>8. Michael Andretti (U.S.), Swift Ford Cosworth, 52.196</p>
<p>9. Greg Moore (Canada), Reynard Mercedes, 52.200</p>
<p>10. Scott Pruett (U.S.), Reynard Ford Cosworth, 52.282</p>
</text>
